Error [E0102]: nothing named `print_all` exists here
  --> tests/ui/generic_square_brackets.jet:2:5
    |
  2 |     print_all([1, 2, 3])
    |     ^^^^^^^^^
 Why: only functions that have been defined (or built in, like `print` / `input`) can be called
 Fix: define it first (fn print_all() { ... }), or call one that exists
